<title>UK: Tate &amp; Lyle no comment on price fix probe.</title>
<headline>Tate &amp; Lyle no comment on price fix probe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar producer Tate &amp; Lyle declined to comment on stockmarket talk that its North American subsidiary A.E. Staley may be included in a U.S. federal investigation into price fixing in the corn sweeteners market.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment to make at this stage,&quot; said a spokesman at Tate &amp; Lyle.</p>
<p>On Tuesday a U.S. court accepted a guilty plea from producer Archer Daniels Midland Co and fined the company for fixing prices in some related additives but justice officials said they would continue an investigation into two company officials.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
